Dear {!Contact.FirstName},
Your student ID was mailed but has been returned to us by the US Postal Service. Before we will mail your student ID, we need you to verify the mailing address at which you wish to receive your ID. Please reply to this email with your full name and mailing address.
Regards, {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
Sun Devil Card Services Arizona State University Phone: 480-965-2273 cardservices.asu.edu
If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.
